SUMMARY (Avionics)

PCB designs (KiCad schematics, layouts, Gerber files) are licensed under CERN-OHL-W v2.
Embedded firmware and software modules follow separate licensing per file header
(typically MIT or GPL v3; see firmware/LICENSE).

Documentation (READMEs, design guides, pinout specifications) is licensed under CC BY 4.0.

For attribution and contribution guidelines, see:
  ../docs/attribution_and_licensing.md
  ../CONTRIBUTING.md (if present)

